 </template><p v-if="mode==='create'||mode==='copy'" class="muted">保存后默认关闭。成本数据仅为估算，不作为实际账单利润。</p><p v-if="unknown" role="alert" class="pa-alert pa-alert--error">结果未知，请读取原状态核对。</p><button v-if="unknown" type="button" class="pa-btn" :disabled="busy" @click="readOriginal">读取原结果</button><footer class="pa-modal-foot"><button type="button" class="pa-btn" :disabled="busy" @click="close">取消</button><button data-parent-save class="pa-btn pa-btn--primary" :class="{'pa-btn--loading':busy}" :disabled="!canSave">{{busy?'正在保存…':mode==='adopt'?'载入原注册账户配置':'保存'}}</button></footer></form></section></div>
